This project is an independent local-orchestration wrapper around upstream
OpenFugu (https://github.com/trotsky1997/OpenFugu) and the TRINITY router
research from Sakana AI. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored
by Sakana AI.

The Apache-2.0 licensed source files in this repository were written by the
mantis maintainers unless otherwise noted in individual file headers.

Third-party components used at runtime include (but are not limited to):
- OpenFugu (https://github.com/trotsky1997/OpenFugu) — incorporated as a pinned
  git submodule.
- Qwen3-0.6B and associated adapted router heads from Hugging Face.
- Bifrost for external model routing.
- NVIDIA NeMo Switchyard for `mantis/base` model selection.
